#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:7
#: ffa7249b8fb740e48c8a9f1f37adaf46
msgid "CADDX Gimbals"
msgstr "CADDX云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:9
#: 335ff6e45a9b4d75b86ca3322e76331a
msgid ""
"`CADDX <https://caddxfpv.com/products/caddxfpv-gm1-gm2-gm3.html>`__ GM1, "
"GM2, GM3 gimbals are small 1, 2 and 3-axis gimbals weighing between 16g and "
"46g and can be paired with 19mm x 19mm FPV cameras"
msgstr ""
"`CADDX <https://caddxfpv.com/products/caddxfpv-gm1-gm2-gm3.html>`__ "
"GM1、GM2、GM3 云台是重量在16g至46g之间的小型1、2和3轴云台，可与19mm x 19mm的FPV摄像头配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:16
#: 7029bc1e8de742ac8e0e05133330d2a5
msgid ""
"Support for these gimbals is available in ArduPilot 4.6 (and higher) and "
"requires the gimbal's firmware be 3.4 (or higher)"
msgstr "ArduPilot 4.6（及更高版本）支持这些云台，且要求云台固件版本为3.4（或更高）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:18
#: 0b290813c94a4b38be605388d7e6165c
msgid ""
"The `user manual can be found here "
"<https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0036/3921/4169/files/GM_Series_Manual_V1.0_1.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"`用户手册可在此处找到 "
"<https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0036/3921/4169/files/GM_Series_Manual_V1.0_1.pdf>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:21
#: b412601b1577477982384fe07c8b08dd
msgid "Where and What to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道及型号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:23
#: 2980048bb860440ebea8cf9734458973
msgid ""
"The GM1, GM2 and GM3 gimbals can be purchased directly from `CADDXFPV "
"<https://caddxfpv.com/products/caddxfpv-gm1-gm2-gm3.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"GM1、GM2和GM3云台可直接从 `CADDXFPV <https://caddxfpv.com/products/caddxfpv-"
"gm1-gm2-gm3.html>`__ 购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:24
#: 590d063925b34a999af60b5addf3f3a7
msgid ""
"The `GL and GM Upgrade Cable <https://caddxfpv.com/products/gl-and-gm-"
"upgrade-cable>`__ can be used to upgrade the gimbal's firmware to 3.4 (or "
"higher). Any FTDI to serial adapter connected to a 3 pin .1mm SH cable can "
"also be used."
msgstr ""
"`GL和GM升级线缆 <https://caddxfpv.com/products/gl-and-gm-upgrade-cable>`__ "
"可用于将云台固件升级至3.4（或更高）。也可使用连接至3针.1mm SH线缆的任意FTDI转串口适配器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:27
#: f7eee074ddf54e68ae74b8493a166959
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:33
#: 5d1b6dc5cc1d4e4c86fbfab8eb8289c7
msgid ""
"Connect the gimbal's RX, TX and GND pins to one of the autopilot's serial "
"ports as shown above"
msgstr "将云台的RX、TX和GND引脚连接至飞控的某个串口，如上图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:35
#: 77b2e2069fa0453396779cd2e2c02eab
msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station and set the following parameters.  The params "
"below assume the autopilot's telem2 port is used"
msgstr "连接地面站并设置以下参数。下列参数假定使用飞控的 telem2 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:37
#: ee7627b103ce42d98607e778459c8272
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` to 8 (\"Gimbal\")"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设为 8（\"Gimbal\"）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:38
#: 37bc2b25857b43b18475ec3743cb23cd
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` to \"115\" for 115200 bps"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` 设置为 「115」（115200 bps）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:39
#: ab4c4857f0654c8c9f91f3d22774cb69
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` to \"13\" (\"CADDX\") and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` 设置为 「13」（「CADDX」），然后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:40
#: 7728fadc2bad4f2287ea1ab385122014
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` to -90"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` 设为 -90"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:41
#: 7ce0beecc5fc4cb0b9ee1b4f5a1d2f18
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` to 90"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` 设置为90。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:42
#: 6a454a508890414e9630220b19e74169
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` to -170"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` 设置为-170。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:43
#: 7e9dea01a4db452c9a66d39ccc3b4c70
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` to 170"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` 设置为170。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:44
#: f83c77ee40084e3883b5e2536a4054d8
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` to 60 (deg/s) to control speed of gimbal "
"when using RC targeting if controlling the movement RATE by RC is desired. "
"If RC value is intended to control the ANGLE, then set it to 0."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` "
"设置为60（度/秒），用于在使用RC瞄准时控制云台转动速度（如果希望通过RC控制转动速率）。若RC值意在控制角度，则设置为0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:45
#: b5a37d3ac34541c097bca668acc9c9e7
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213 (\"Mount Pitch\") to control the "
"gimbal's pitch angle with RC channel 6"
msgstr ":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213（\"Mount Pitch\"），用 RC 通道 6 控制云台俯仰角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:46
#: d839ebe255dc4d08bcbaa7de326a3959
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214 (\"Mount Yaw\") to control the gimbal's"
" yaw angle with RC channel 7"
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214（\"Mount Yaw\"），用 RC 通道 7 控制云台偏航角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:47
#: 9480521a71c841fa83c5690edec5f4ce
msgid ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 163 (\"Mount Lock\") to switch between "
"\"lock\" and \"follow\" mode with RC channel 8"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 163（\"Mount Lock\"），用 RC 通道 8 "
"在\"锁定\"与\"跟随\"模式间切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:50
#: 8cc69cb1be1b43748c103de5339951e8
msgid "Configuring the Gimbal"
msgstr "配置云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:52
#: 6eac9c13f905474b89958707e40a39ec
msgid ""
"Firmware upgrade instructions are in the \"Upgrade\" section of the `user "
"manual "
"<https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0036/3921/4169/files/GM_Series_Manual_V1.0_1.pdf>`__"
" but in short:"
msgstr ""
"固件升级说明在 `用户手册 "
"<https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0036/3921/4169/files/GM_Series_Manual_V1.0_1.pdf>`__"
" 的「升级」章节，简要步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:54
#: ca0b97b49a724df28f35cad0754b8b43
msgid ""
"Download the GimbalConfig windows application and latest gimbal firmware "
"from the `CADDXFPV Download Center <https://caddxfpv.com/pages/download-"
"center>`__ (look for the \"Firmware / GM Gimbal Firmware\" link near the "
"bottom of the page)"
msgstr ""
"从 `CADDXFPV下载中心 <https://caddxfpv.com/pages/download-center>`__ "
"下载GimbalConfig Windows应用程序和最新云台固件（在页面底部附近查找「Firmware / GM Gimbal "
"Firmware」链接）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:55
#: a3b583d53adc4afe9c7e22ce9ede3ec5
msgid ""
"Extract the contents of the downloaded zip file and run the GimbalConfig "
"application"
msgstr "解压下载的zip文件并运行GimbalConfig应用程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:56
#: 85dd6a8e8ccc4deaa9e31b13eb7b8a31
msgid ""
"Connect the `Upgrade Cable <https://caddxfpv.com/products/gl-and-gm-upgrade-"
"cable>`__ or FTDI adapter to the upgrade port shown below, connect the other"
" end to your PC"
msgstr ""
"将 `升级线缆 <https://caddxfpv.com/products/gl-and-gm-upgrade-cable>`__ "
"或FTDI适配器连接至下图所示的升级接口，另一端连接至电脑。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:62
#: 62429cb91fcc4d67b68b9da011714e46
msgid ""
"Open the GimbalConfig application, select the COM port, then \"Open\" and "
"find the \"CwGimbalZGV2Main_V3.4.cahf\" file and push \"Upgrade\""
msgstr ""
"打开GimbalConfig应用程序，选择COM端口，然后点击「Open」，找到「CwGimbalZGV2Main_V3.4.cahf」文件并点击「Upgrade」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:68
#: 0596038a0e794acc9a1825c6a3291298
msgid ""
"Ensure the channel drop-downs highlighted in orange above are set to CH01 "
"and then push the \"Save Param To Flash\" button"
msgstr "确保上图中橙色高亮的通道下拉菜单设置为CH01，然后点击「Save Param To Flash」按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:71
#: 793da44e944f4dec88b8bb13577ef058
msgid "Control and Testing"
msgstr "控制与测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:73
#: 9939c741887a42ef876f13add0a899c5
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Gimbal / Mount Controls <common-mount-targeting>` for details on "
"how to control the camera and gimbal using RC, GCS or Auto mode mission "
"commands"
msgstr ""
"有关使用RC、GCS或自动模式任务命令控制摄像头和云台的详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`云台/挂载控制 <common-mount-"
"targeting>`。"
